{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"75396a02c9d8e4fd4cdfa846f2da4822dcf7ddc55efb668713e66b511568fee3","ja":"ちょ、ちょっと未来ちゃん！\n『好きな人』が●●●●プロデューサーって……！","zh":"等、等等未来！\n“喜欢的人”是●●●●制作人这也太……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0820209d40f4f7bd94ac9113a617bcca481ce3b8808ea33309b0dd2c04730ffe","ja":"うん♪　私、●●●●プロデューサーさんのこと\n大好きだから♪　それに～……。","zh":"嗯♪ 因为我最喜欢\n●●●●制作人先生了嘛♪ 而且～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"62b5ccbc28f7312a3b5b3b08b9f8f7fbcadff103eb016b1eb0b6d30fd85a5cd8","ja":"う、うん。そ、それに……！？","zh":"嗯、嗯。而、而且……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8dfce9e5ae5d8068130cbd4c4ee6c86fbf0b713a8ff590fce6dd30993faae759","ja":"家族とか、学校の友達とか、劇場のみんなとか！\n好きな人、たくさんいるよ♪","zh":"家人啦、学校的朋友啦、剧场的大家啦！\n喜欢的人有很多哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a069dc2f5113ea6fffcb236e856604bd57fc91c5a00d53359e0ec243dfca5d7c","ja":"な、なんだ、そういう好きな人ってこと……。\nあははっ、ちょっとビックリしちゃったよ。","zh":"什、什么嘛，原来是这种“喜欢的人”啊……\n啊哈哈，还真有点吓到我了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2a022195e5233d3bea3bc8bf87360657bc20f49787e1f920b44752eaf7004506","ja":"でもそっか……イメージする人が\n●●●●プロデューサーなのはいい考えかも。","zh":"不过也是呢……把想象的对象\n当作●●●●制作人，或许是个好主意。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"957a52b7ed888475aff7ec254d35f27137d4ea41b7fd278043de3548f44ae548","ja":"うん！　仕事のときいつも見守ってくれてるし！\nすごく頼りになるもんね。","zh":"嗯！工作的时候也一直都在注视着我！\n真的很靠得住呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7cb7f0cef44b3e007db3c06cf045d0a5c9301c70b0e9e191cf02164ef254e164","ja":"じゃあ～、アタシも\n●●●●プロデューサーにしようかな♪","zh":"那～，我也叫\n●●●●制作人好了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"263d0f364692f4528e9f0b91308719d7b4ee4f93b0441389631d3abcd86420e0","ja":"ほほう、●●●●プロデューサーちゃん\n大人気だね！","zh":"吼吼，●●●●小制作人\n真受欢迎呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"958b0f15a7b458a5b6510c3e7cd2ecb6926a82e8785e8a53e16a5bc073b9cd82","ja":"そういう茜はどうするの？\n候補に●●●●プロデューサーは入ってないの？","zh":"那茜你自己打算怎么办？\n候选名单里没有把●●●●制作人算进去吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b9ff39fb9ee6bd23ac0bac258deaf4cae38f11d75ee627991c62639e3c035aa1","ja":"茜ちゃんは、茜ちゃんのことを大好きな\n何千何万の人たちをイメージしてたけど……。","zh":"小茜之前想象的是，\n成千上万深爱着小茜的人们，可是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f3c7883fdc7aa6fcdf2580c63dd1a2d7e227f12ae4fab43d38acf2b3cd49ba62","ja":"そこに●●●●プロデューサーちゃんを\n入れてあげてもいいかな！","zh":"把●●●●小制作人也\n加进那里也不是不行哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"c6c4ef0cfb39590123c6756963b095f7364a35d1fdce8cf230e908fd0e8abf21","ja":"そ、そっか……。\nたくさんの人のことを思ってやるんだね。","zh":"是、这样啊……\n是为了许多人着想才去做的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1006.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"7bfda1f818ab56e132c7041472a2fdd31f74bf9b43490b03d9a7bc2c487c78c5","ja":"そう！　困っちゃうくらいモテモテ茜ちゃん……\nふふん、いいCM撮影になりそうだね～！","zh":"没错！大受欢迎到让人伤脑筋的小茜……\n哼哼，感觉会是一次很棒的广告拍摄呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
